      "header": "List AWS Lambda Functions",
      "description": "Having an accessible list of all AWS Lambda functions deployed on your AWS account is crucial for orchestration and auditing. It allows for dynamic function selection and invocation, thus making your processes more versatile and adaptive to changing needs.",
