      "header": "Invoke AWS Lambda Function",
      "description": "Direct invocation of AWS Lambda functions from Camunda via Apache Camel offers you real-time, serverless compute capabilities. This feature is particularly useful for scenarios such as data transformation, event-driven processing, and other tasks that require scalable, on-the-fly computation.",
